---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="联系与勘误台 ｜ 数据更正与事实反馈"
  description="机场梯子调查公报勘误接待台。若您发现本站收录的服务商价格、线路或协议信息存在出入，请直接通过邮件或电报联络我们核实更正。"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: '首页', url: '/' },
    { name: '勘误联系', url: '/contact/' }
  ]}
>
  <div class="gazette-container py-8 sm:py-12">
    <!-- Header Box -->
    <header class="border-b-4 border-[#1a1816] pb-8 mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#b45309] text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold mb-3">
        <span>ERRATA & INQUIRIES</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>勘误与联络</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Sole primary H1 for this page (HG-08) -->
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-serif text-[#1a1816] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
        联系与勘误台：服务商信息更正与事实反馈
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#44403c] font-serif leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-[#b45309] pl-4 py-1 bg-[#efece4]/40">
        保持数据档案的真实性与时效性是本公报立足的核心。我们非常欢迎广大读者、技术极客以及各服务商运营团队提供第一手确凿资料与勘误指正。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto space-y-8">
      <!-- Direct Contact Channels (Real channels, zero fake submit simulation) -->
      <div class="border-2 border-[#1a1816] bg-white p-6 shadow-gazette">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#1a1816] mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[#d6d1c7]">
          官方直接联络渠道
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans">
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#efece4]/50 border border-[#d6d1c7] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 block">编辑部主邮箱 (Primary Email)</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-stone-500">负责勘误修正、线索提供与合作咨询</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[#b45309] bg-white px-3 py-1 border border-[#d6d1c7]">
              editor@jichangtizi.com
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 bg-[#efece4]/50 border border-[#d6d1c7] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 block">Telegram 在线通联通道</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-stone-500">用于突发线路中断反馈或即时交流</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1816] bg-white px-3 py-1 border border-[#d6d1c7]">
              @jichangtizi_editor
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Errata Guidelines -->
      <div class="border border-[#d6d1c7] bg-[#efece4]/40 p-6 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-sm text-[#1a1816] mb-2">
          勘误提交指引说明
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-2">
          为确保信息修改的客观中立，请在提交纠错邮件时尽可能附带以下凭证材料：
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-stone-600">
          <li>相关服务商的官方公告链接或官方网站截图；</li>
          <li>发生变动的具体参数（如套餐价格调整、线路架构更新、新协议支持等）；</li>
          <li>若属于服务商团队官方更正，请使用带有服务商域名的企业邮箱进行发送。</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 m-0 text-stone-500 text-[11px] font-mono">
          收到核验材料后，我们通常会在 1-3 个工作日内对全站静态数据源及生成页面完成重新构建与同步。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
